# Paths no build or test reads. A push to main that changes only these skips
# the merge gate and the version guard in pre-push. One shell pattern a line,
# matched against the whole path, where * crosses folders. The last line that
# matches wins, and a leading ! keeps a path gated.
# The hook reads this file from the commit being pushed, and a change to it is
# always gated.

*.md
project/*
assets/demo.gif
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*
.github/FUNDING.yml
.github/CODEOWNERS

# Built into the binary or the packages.
!usage.md
!shell-integration.md
!license.md
# Read by tests: the pins, showdown and scrim tests, and the wallpaper gallery
# check, which reads the pack's attribution too.
!README.md
!build.md
!prerequisites.md
!comparison.md
!project/design_docs/*_scrim.md
!filesystem/*
